---
.title = "Use Io Process and Terminal Capabilities",
.date = "2026-09-29",
.author = "ZigCC",
.layout = "section.shtml",
---

The process-facing Io APIs expose the current path and executable path without
global state. File terminal APIs report whether output is a TTY and whether ANSI
escape codes are supported.

